# Flask API origin. Optional.
#  - Development: the app always calls relative /api paths and the Vite dev
#    server proxies them to this origin (default http://localhost:8080).
#    Set it only if Flask runs somewhere else.
#  - Production build: required if the API is not served from the same origin
#    as the static files, since there is no proxy in front of dist/.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
